  "title": {
    "zh": "益智DIY搭建帐篷套装",
    "en": "Educational DIY Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款益智DIY搭建帐篷套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，支持拆装房子与亲子拼搭玩法。",
    "en": "This is an educational DIY tent building set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It supports detachable-house and parent-child building play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款益智DIY搭建帐篷套装采用模块化拼接结构，可围绕帐篷、通道和互动空间进行多形态搭建，适合儿童持续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、课程教具和活动场景布置，可用于动手能力、手眼协调和协作玩法训练。",
      "包装参数包含体积、重量和尺寸信息，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This educational DIY tent building set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event-space setup, helping develop hands-on ability, hand-eye coordination, and collaborative play skills.",
      "Packaging includes volume, weight, and size data for channel display, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
